#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:1
msgid "LoRa 基站架设"
msgstr "Setting Up the LoRa Base Station"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:6
msgid ""
"完成 LoRa 套件中**专用 D13 基站**的安装、供电与稳定架设。该基站不单独销售，也不作为移动站使用；移动站连接见[LoRa "
"移动站连接](lora.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Complete the installation, power supply, and stable setup of the "
"**dedicated D13 base station** in the LoRa kit. This base station is not "
"sold separately and is not used as a rover; connections for the rover can"
" be found at [Connecting a LoRa Rover](lora.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:9
msgid "设备用途"
msgstr "Equipment Use"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:11
msgid ""
"专用 D13 LoRa 基站负责接收卫星信号并通过 LoRa 链路向 D20 或 D13 "
"移动站发送内部差分数据。基站和移动站出厂默认配对，上电自动连接。"
msgstr ""
"The dedicated D13 LoRa base station is responsible for receiving "
"satellite signals and sending internal correction data to D20 or D13 "
"rovers via the LoRa link. The base station and rovers are factory-paired "
"by default and automatically connect when powered on."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:18
msgid "专用 D13 LoRa 基站实物图"
msgstr "Photo of the dedicated D13 LoRa base station"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:18
msgid "专用 D13 LoRa 基站"
msgstr "Dedicated D13 LoRa base station"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:21
msgid "工作频率：默认 915 MHz。"
msgstr "Operating frequency: default 915 MHz."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:22
msgid "拓扑：一个局部场景只允许一个基站，可一对一或一对多，最多连接 4096 个移动站，不支持多对多。"
msgstr ""
"Topology: A local scenario allows only one base station, can be one-to-"
"one or one-to-many, connects up to 4096 rovers, and does not support "
"many-to-many."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:23
msgid "距离：最远约 6 km。"
msgstr "Distance: Approximately 6 km at the farthest."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:25
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable Scenarios"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:27
msgid "园区机器人。"
msgstr "Park robots."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:28
msgid "农机作业。"
msgstr "Agricultural machinery operation."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:29
msgid "低空无人机。"
msgstr "Low-altitude drone."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:30
msgid "临时测量和固定区域高精度定位。"
msgstr "Temporary measurement and high-precision positioning of fixed areas."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:32
msgid "安装要求"
msgstr "Installation requirements"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "要求"
msgstr "Requirement"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "安装位置"
msgstr "Installation location"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "开阔、无遮挡、尽量远离高楼和树木"
msgstr "Open, unobstructed, and try to stay away from tall buildings and trees"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "固定方式"
msgstr "Fixing method"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "三脚架加支杆固定，保持设备稳定"
msgstr "Tripod with support rod for stabilization, keeping the equipment steady"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "天线安装"
msgstr "Antenna Installation"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "D13 基站和 LoRa 数据天线需牢固安装"
msgstr "Securely install the D13 base station and LoRa data antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "USB 连接"
msgstr "USB connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "使用配套的封装 4-pin USB 线缆；接 USB 电源可直接供电，接电脑可供电并进行 USB 串口通信"
msgstr ""
"Use the matching sealed 4-pin USB cable; it can be powered directly when "
"connected to a USB power source, and when connected to a computer, it can"
" provide power and perform USB serial communication."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "工作状态"
msgstr "Work status"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:13
msgid "上电后保持静止，不要移动基站"
msgstr "Keep still after powering on, do not move the base station"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:42
msgid "安装步骤"
msgstr "Installation Steps"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:44
msgid "选择开阔地面并架设三脚架。"
msgstr "Choose an open area and set up a tripod."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:45
msgid "安装支杆和垫片，固定好结构。"
msgstr "Install the support rods and spacers, and secure the structure."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:46
msgid "将专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件固定在支杆顶部。"
msgstr ""
"Secure the dedicated D13 LoRa base station hardware at the top of the "
"pole."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:47
msgid "连接基站外置 LoRa 天线，并调整到合适朝向。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the base station's external LoRa antenna and adjust it to the "
"appropriate orientation."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:48
msgid "检查基站本体、支杆和三脚架均已可靠固定。"
msgstr "Check that the base station body, pole, and tripod are all securely fixed."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:49
msgid "将配套 USB 线缆连接基站，再接入 USB 电源；需要查看基站数据时可直接连接电脑进行 USB 串口通信。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the matching USB cable to the base station, then plug in the USB "
"power; when you need to check the base station data, you can directly "
"connect it to a computer for USB serial communication."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:50
msgid "上电后保持基站位置不变；如果移动过基站，应重新上电。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the base station in the same position after powering on; if the base"
" station has been moved, it should be powered on again."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:52
msgid "提示"
msgstr "Tip"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:55
msgid "LoRa 基站和移动站出厂默认配对，上电自动连接。差分数据在 LoRa 链路内部传输，不需要用户配置外部差分协议。"
msgstr ""
"The LoRa base station and rover are paired by default at the factory and "
"automatically connect when powered on. Correction data is transmitted "
"within the LoRa link and does not require users to configure an external "
"correction-data protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:59
msgid "只使用配套 USB 线缆 基站内部接口线不向用户开放。不要拆开线缆、改接内部导线或使用非配套转接线，以免因错误供电或信号线误接损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"Only use the provided USB cable. The internal interface cables of the "
"base station are not accessible to users. Do not dismantle the cables, "
"rewire internal wires, or use non-provided adapter cables, to avoid "
"damaging the device due to incorrect power supply or misconnection of "
"signal lines."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:62
msgid "使用提示"
msgstr "Usage Instructions"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:64
msgid "基站上电后不要移动位置。"
msgstr "Do not move the base station after powering it on."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:65
msgid "基站与移动站之间应尽量保持视距或弱遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"There should be line-of-sight or minimal obstruction between the base "
"station and the rover whenever possible."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:66
msgid "现场如有强电磁干扰、金属遮挡或高压线路，应优先调整站点位置。"
msgstr ""
"If there is strong electromagnetic interference, metal obstruction, or "
"high-voltage lines on site, the station location should be adjusted as a "
"priority."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:67
msgid "同一区域不要同时开启多个基站。"
msgstr "Do not operate multiple base stations in the same area at the same time."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:69
msgid "基站架设完成判据"
msgstr "Base Station Setup Completion Criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:72
msgid "基站位于开阔位置，结构、外置 LoRa 天线和供电连接牢靠；上电后位置保持不变，同一区域没有开启其他基站。"
msgstr ""
"The base station is located in an open area, with its structure, external"
" LoRa antenna, and power connections secure; after being powered on, its "
"position remains unchanged, and no other base stations have been "
"activated in the same area."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/d13-base-station.md:75
msgid "完成架设后，继续执行[LoRa 移动站连接](lora.md)。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the setup, continue to execute [Connecting a LoRa "
"Rover](lora.md)."
